## Q8. Difference between Worksheet and Dashboard.

**Worksheet:**
- A single visualization (chart, graph, or map).

**Dashboard:**
- Combination of multiple worksheets displayed together.

**Why dashboards are useful:**
- Provide complete business overview in one screen.
- Allow interactive filtering across charts.
- Help decision-makers quickly understand insights.

